  <data name="EnvDesc_Hall" xml:space="preserve"><value>An empty concert hall: a short pause, then a long, warm echo from every wall.</value></data>
  <data name="EnvDesc_Cinema" xml:space="preserve"><value>An old single-screen theatre: a vintage, slightly muffled tail and a slap back from the rear wall.</value></data>
